    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You need the money.</strong> That\u2019s it. There are no laws, morals, or theological ideologies that will change the facts. You must save Mom. Are you willing to sacrifice the needs of these strangers they call your coworkers? They aren\u2019t going to stand by and let you. Are you willing to feed the rot that poisons the world? Maybe taking the job is already doing so. Can you burn it all down? You have to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/8410a8a9793ab512b6baa23cf9f944a7.poster.avif?t=1754349440\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/8410a8a9793ab512b6baa23cf9f944a7.webm?t=1754349440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/8410a8a9793ab512b6baa23cf9f944a7.mp4?t=1754349440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Instruments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accuracy and precision are both keys to success. Develop expertise in handling your implements to improve your efficiency and avoid mistakes. More accurate, more precise, more commission. However, avoid habits and remain alert. Daily challenges can break your routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/63ff5e41c49ced7dbb69bd6ae1d402ad.poster.avif?t=1754349440\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/63ff5e41c49ced7dbb69bd6ae1d402ad.webm?t=1754349440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/63ff5e41c49ced7dbb69bd6ae1d402ad.mp4?t=1754349440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make an Impact</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with your coworkers at work and family and friends from home. Remember: your interactions with everyone you talk to can dramatically shift the world around you in both future discussions and your work day. Give somebody advice? They might take it in a way that alters their life. Make too much money one day? Someone might get jealous and take desperate action against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/ce57736b97b0b8a8709d3e853c849f59.poster.avif?t=1754349440\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/ce57736b97b0b8a8709d3e853c849f59.webm?t=1754349440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/ce57736b97b0b8a8709d3e853c849f59.mp4?t=1754349440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Workstation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchasing upgrades is another excellent way to increase productivity. Many items can lessen your workload, boost your earnings, and make your ingredients easier to keep track of. There are also ways to aesthetically customize your space, so your work environment is as comfortable as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/f3802a8c8ad685f2102596830f001ae1.poster.avif?t=1754349440\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/f3802a8c8ad685f2102596830f001ae1.webm?t=1754349440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766480/extras/f3802a8c8ad685f2102596830f001ae1.mp4?t=1754349440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every company has a skeleton in the closet. With Max Potency, however, the term &quot;Corporate Hell&quot; may not be as metaphorical as it seems. Choose if you will take what you need and get out, or if you will risk everything to help make them pay.</p>",
